@startuml
[*] --> Created : new Circle(...) / new Rectangle(...)
Created --> AreaCalculated : accept(areaCalculator)
note right of AreaCalculated
  visitCircle(this) computes pi * r^2
  visitRectangle(this) computes width * height
end note
AreaCalculated --> Drawn : accept(drawer)
note right of Drawn
  visitCircle(this) / visitRectangle(this)
  prints the drawing command
end note
Drawn --> [*]
@enduml
